{
  "slug": "agent-as-policy-robodojo",
  "title": "Agent as Policy on RoboDojo: 42 Tasks, One General-Purpose Agent",
  "published": "2026-10-16",
  "dateLabel": "October 16, 2026",
  "category": "Research",
  "author": "RealHand Inc.",
  "excerpt": "Our Agent as Policy evaluation spans 42 simulated dual-arm tasks and 2,100 episodes, reaching a 63.63 average score and 56.13% success rate on seed 0.",
  "hero": "/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/fold_clothes.jpg",
  "heroAlt": "Two simulated robot arms folding a shirt in the RoboDojo benchmark",
  "bodyHtml": "<nav class=\"article-contents\" aria-label=\"Article sections\"><a href=\"#overview\">Overview</a><a href=\"#method\">Method</a><a href=\"#results\">Results</a><a href=\"#task-videos\">Task videos</a><a href=\"#resources\">Resources</a></nav>\n<p>Self-evaluation using the official scoring script. Leaderboard comparisons use the October 14, 2026 snapshot.</p>\n<figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/fold_clothes.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"AGP folds a shirt with two simulated robot arms\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fold_clothes_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fold_clothes_head.mp4\">Watch the folding demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption><span>Two arms. One agent. A folded shirt.</span> <span>RoboDojo simulation</span></figcaption></figure>\n<dl class=\"article-stats\"><div><dt>Average score</dt><dd>63.63</dd><p>Mean of five capability scores</p></div><div><dt>Success rate</dt><dd>56.13%</dd><p>Mean of five capability success rates</p></div><div><dt>Manipulation tasks</dt><dd>42</dd><p>One agent, prompt, and toolset</p></div><div><dt>Evaluated episodes</dt><dd>2,100</dd><p>Seed 0 · randomized layouts</p></div></dl>\n<section id=\"overview\"><h2>Putting an agent in the control loop.</h2>\n<p>What if the robot policy were a general-purpose AI agent? We evaluated Agent as Policy (AGP) on RoboDojo, where one agent observes, reasons, commands two robot arms, and checks the result across 42 manipulation tasks.</p>\n<p>RoboDojo evaluates generalist policies on a simulated dual-arm ARX X5 robot. Randomized layouts test whether a policy can adapt its actions, handle precise contact, complete long sequences, remember earlier observations, and follow new instructions.</p>\n<p>For RealHand, this is a way to study the intelligence behind manipulation: how a robot can turn an instruction into a sequence of physical actions, then use feedback to revise that sequence.</p>\n<dl class=\"article-capabilities\">\n<div><dt>Generalization</dt><dd>Familiar skills with new objects and scene variations.</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Precision</dt><dd>Fine insertion, stacking, and alignment.</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Long-Horizon</dt><dd>Many manipulation steps completed in sequence.</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Memory</dt><dd>Remembering observations from earlier in an episode.</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Open</dt><dd>Unseen tasks specified through language.</dd></div>\n</dl></section>\n<section id=\"method\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How AGP works</p><h2>Observe. Reason. Act. Repeat.</h2>\n<p>AGP places a general-purpose LLM agent in charge of task execution. In this evaluation, GPT-6-Astra running in Codex uses camera observations and the robot&#x27;s joint readings to decide what to do next. Motion planning translates the agent&#x27;s targets into arm trajectories.</p>\n<p>The same agent, prompt, and tools are used across all 42 tasks. AGP receives a task instruction and short written task notes, with no RoboDojo demonstrations, benchmark-specific training or fine-tuning, or access to hidden simulator state.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><h3>Observe</h3><p>Read the overhead and two wrist-camera images.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Measure</h3><p>Point to objects in the images to estimate where to act.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Plan &amp; move</h3><p>Choose arm targets; a motion planner generates trajectories.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Verify &amp; recover</h3><p>Look again, check progress, and correct slips or missed grasps.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Finish</h3><p>Declare completion; RoboDojo&#x27;s checker scores the episode.</p></li>\n</ol></section>\n<section id=\"results\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Evaluation results</p><h2>A strong result across five capabilities.</h2>\n<p>Our seed-0 run reaches 63.63 average score and 56.13% success. For context, EmbodiedEvo, the top entry in the October 14 leaderboard snapshot, records 45.08 and 38.95%. AGP scores higher than that entry in each of the five capability categories.</p>\n<aside class=\"article-note\"><h3>Evaluation scope</h3>\n<p>AGP: our own evaluation on seed 0, all 42 tasks and 2,100 episodes, scored with RoboDojo&#x27;s unmodified official scoring script. The official leaderboard evaluates three seeds, so these comparisons use different seed coverage. An official three-seed evaluation may produce different results. Averages are the mean of the five category results.</p>\n</aside>\n<figure><a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig1_average_score.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Average score. AGP self-evaluation: seed 0. Reference entries: official leaderboard snapshot dated October 14, 2026, evaluated over three seeds.\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig1_average_score.png\" alt=\"Average scores: AGP 63.63, EmbodiedEvo 45.08, VPP2 39.26, PhysicalRSI 36.27, Awomo-0.5 35.34, Simate-beta 33.95, GPT-6-Astra 28.97\" width=\"1800\" height=\"880\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>AGP self-evaluation: seed 0. Reference entries: official leaderboard snapshot dated October 14, 2026, evaluated over three seeds. Select the chart to view it full size.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig2_success_rate.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Success rate. AGP self-evaluation: seed 0. Reference entries: official leaderboard snapshot dated October 14, 2026, evaluated over three seeds.\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig2_success_rate.png\" alt=\"Success rates: AGP 56.13%, EmbodiedEvo 38.95%, VPP2 32.26%, PhysicalRSI 31.38%, Awomo-0.5 29.64%, Simate-beta 27.96%, GPT-6-Astra 22.48%\" width=\"1800\" height=\"880\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>AGP self-evaluation: seed 0. Reference entries: official leaderboard snapshot dated October 14, 2026, evaluated over three seeds. Select the chart to view it full size.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"article-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Numerical model comparison\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><caption>AGP seed-0 results and selected entries from the October 14, 2026 official leaderboard</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Model</th><th scope=\"col\">Average score</th><th scope=\"col\">Success rate</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">AGP (ours, seed 0)</th><td>63.63</td><td>56.13%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">EmbodiedEvo</th><td>45.08</td><td>38.95%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">VPP2</th><td>39.26</td><td>32.26%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">PhysicalRSI</th><td>36.27</td><td>31.38%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Awomo-0.5</th><td>35.34</td><td>29.64%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Simate-beta</th><td>33.95</td><td>27.96%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">GPT-6-Astra</th><td>28.97</td><td>22.48%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div><h3>Where AGP performs best—and what remains hard</h3>\n<p>Memory is the strongest category, at 92.22 score and 91.00% success. Long-horizon tasks remain more difficult: their 49.48 score and 28.75% success rate show the gap between making partial progress and reliably completing a whole sequence.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig3_score_by_category.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Open full-size Category scores for AGP (seed 0) and EmbodiedEvo (October 14 leaderboard snapshot).\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/figures/fig3_score_by_category.png\" alt=\"AGP scores by category: Generalization 59.79, Precision 50.90, Long-Horizon 49.48, Memory 92.22, and Open 65.75, compared with EmbodiedEvo\" width=\"1800\" height=\"840\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Category scores for AGP (seed 0) and EmbodiedEvo (October 14 leaderboard snapshot).</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"article-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Category scores and success rates\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><caption>Generalization combines the standard and randomized subsets with equal weight. Reference: EmbodiedEvo.</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Category</th><th scope=\"col\">AGP score</th><th scope=\"col\">AGP success</th><th scope=\"col\">Reference score</th><th scope=\"col\">Reference success</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Generalization</th><td>59.79</td><td>54.67%</td><td>35.22</td><td>30.83%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Precision</th><td>50.90</td><td>44.00%</td><td>25.15</td><td>16.25%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Long-Horizon</th><td>49.48</td><td>28.75%</td><td>33.83</td><td>21.75%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Memory</th><td>92.22</td><td>91.00%</td><td>79.40</td><td>76.67%</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Open</th><td>65.75</td><td>62.25%</td><td>51.81</td><td>49.25%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\"article-downloads\"><a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/data/agp_seed0_result.csv\" download>Download AGP results (CSV)</a><a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/data/robodojo_leaderboard_2026-10-14.csv\" download>Download leaderboard snapshot (CSV)</a></p></section>\n<section id=\"task-videos\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">See it in action</p><h2>From folding to reasoning.</h2>\n<p>17 selected demonstrations across all five capabilities. Choose a task, then press play. These clips illustrate individual episodes, not aggregate success rates.</p>\n<h3>Generalization</h3>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Fold clothes</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/fold_clothes.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Fold clothes, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fold_clothes_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fold_clothes_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Fold a shirt using both arms.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Hang mugs</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/hang_mugs.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Hang mugs, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/hang_mugs_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/hang_mugs_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Hang all the mugs on the mug rack.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Make toast</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/make_toast.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Make toast, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/make_toast_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/make_toast_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Put two bread slices in the toaster and press the lever.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Pour liquid into a cup</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/pour_liquid_into_cup.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Pour liquid into a cup, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/pour_liquid_into_cup_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/pour_liquid_into_cup_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Pour from a bottle into a cup.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Sort nesting dolls</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/sort_nesting_dolls_by_size.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Sort nesting dolls, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/sort_nesting_dolls_by_size_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/sort_nesting_dolls_by_size_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Line up five nesting dolls from smallest to largest.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Stack bowls</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/stack_bowls_random.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Stack bowls, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/stack_bowls_random_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/stack_bowls_random_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Stack three bowls with randomized colors and scene objects.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Arrange the largest number</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/arrange_largest_number_random.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Arrange the largest number, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/arrange_largest_number_random_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/arrange_largest_number_random_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Arrange digit tiles into the largest number in a randomized scene.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<h3>Precision</h3>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Build a tower</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/build_tower.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Build a tower, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/build_tower_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/build_tower_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Build a tower from wooden blocks and boards.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Play the xylophone</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/play_Xylophone.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Play the xylophone, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/play_Xylophone_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/play_Xylophone_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Pick up the mallet and strike each key from left to right.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Insert tubes</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/insert_tubes.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Insert tubes, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/insert_tubes_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/insert_tubes_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Insert three tubes into a rack one at a time.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<h3>Long-Horizon</h3>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Classify objects</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/classify_objects.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Classify objects, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/classify_objects_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/classify_objects_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Sort objects by category into three baskets.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Complete the stacking toy</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/play_stacking_toy.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Complete the stacking toy, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/play_stacking_toy_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/play_stacking_toy_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Place every piece of the stacking toy on the correct peg.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Fill a pen holder</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/fill_pen_holder.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Fill a pen holder, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fill_pen_holder_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/fill_pen_holder_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Hold the pen holder with one arm and fill it with the other.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<h3>Memory</h3>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Imitate a sorting sequence</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/imitate_sorting_sequence.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Imitate a sorting sequence, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/imitate_sorting_sequence_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/imitate_sorting_sequence_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Observe an object-placement sequence and repeat it from memory.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Cover blocks</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/cover_blocks.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Cover blocks, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/cover_blocks_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/cover_blocks_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Remember the colors of covered blocks and uncover them in order.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<h3>Open</h3>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Solve an equation</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/solve_equation.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Solve an equation, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/solve_equation_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/solve_equation_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Find the missing number or operator, place it on the pad, and reset the arm.</figcaption></figure></details>\n<details class=\"article-demo\"><summary>Pour by language</summary><figure><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/posters/pour_by_language.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" aria-label=\"Pour by language, head camera, simulated RoboDojo task\"><source src=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/pour_by_language_head.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"/assets/blog/robodojo/videos/pour_by_language_head.mp4\">Watch the demonstration</a>.</video><figcaption>Pair three bottles with three bowls according to the instruction.</figcaption></figure></details>\n</section><section id=\"next\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What comes next</p><h2>Toward more adaptable manipulation.</h2>\n<p>These simulation results give us a concrete way to test an agent&#x27;s ability to reason through manipulation, use visual feedback, and recover when an action does not go to plan. They also highlight where reliability needs to improve, especially across long sequences. The linked project and datasets let researchers examine both the outcomes and the steps the agent took to reach them.</p>\n</section><section id=\"resources\"><h2>Explore the work.</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.12541\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read the paper</a> — Agent as Policy for Robotic Manipulation</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://agent-as-policy-2026.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore the project</a> — Method, experiments, and real-robot results</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/agent-as-policy-2026/agent-as-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Browse the code</a> — Agent as Policy implementation</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Agent-as-Policy/agent-as-policy-robodojo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inspect all 2,100 episodes</a> — Simulation videos, observations, and agent execution traces</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Agent-as-Policy/agent-as-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See real-robot trials</a> — The separate physical-robot evaluation dataset</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://robodojo-benchmark.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit RoboDojo</a> — The benchmark and its official leaderboard</li>\n</ul><p>Originally published by <a href=\"https://www.realhand.com/blog/agent-as-policy-robodojo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RealHand Inc.</a> on October 16, 2026.</p></section>",
